      ],
      // [REVISAR] No pudo traducirse a modifier automaticamente.
      descriptionTemplate: "> Iuno Waxing AscentEvery time Iuno casts Basic Attack, Heavy Attack, Dodge Counter, Resonance Skill, Resonance Liberation, or Intro Skill, she gains 1 Shield equal to 32% of her ATK for 15s.",
    },
    {
