      // [NO SOPORTADO] Mecánica/secuencia condicional: requiere modelado manual.
      descriptionTemplate: "When Iuno is in Lunar Cycle, DMG dealt by Moonbow - Basic Attack, Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge, and Moonbow - Dodge Counter is Amplified by 65%. Within a certain period after performing Moonbow - Basic Attack or  Moonbow - Dodge Counter, casting Resonance Skill - Arc Beyond the Edge does not reset the cycle of Moonbow - Basic Attack.",
